# Publishable V2 reproducibility artifacts. The V1 cache/run remains local: it
# is 147 GB. Keep only the selected Stage 1 checkpoint required to continue
# training; resume and failed-experiment checkpoints stay local.
!phase_b_activitynet_v2_run/
!phase_b_activitynet_v2_run/**
phase_b_activitynet_v2_run/**/checkpoints/*
